{"id":"vod_sn_37145","vodId":"37145","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"爱迪奥特曼","name_cn":"爱迪奥特曼","date":"1980-01-01","year":"1980","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/e9357919a3117298a63723c1c3354697.jpg"},"summary":"中学理科老师矢的猛（长谷川初范 饰）是一名心中充满了正义感和责任感的有志之士，对于曾经四处作恶搅得人心惶惶的怪兽，矢的猛深信其实是来自于人类的负能量造就了它们，因此，作为一名老师，矢的猛一直都致力于教导学生们什么是正义，什么是邪恶。　　可是，矢的猛的一己之力实在微薄，怪兽克莱圣特重现人间，给地球带来了重大危机，UGM得知此事，派出了爱迪奥特曼来到地球惩奸除恶。在大山一树（中山仁 饰）和伊藤顺吉（大门正明 饰）的邀请之下，矢的猛加入了他们的队伍，展开了和克莱圣特的殊死搏斗。面对格外强大的敌人，矢的猛是否能够凭借自己的智慧和勇气，获得最终的胜利，保卫地球的和平呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:49:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":50,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s15RTas7Q11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ev0p2pYxfN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/nVQ6dwufwP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/g19cwNgdiP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/sZkLbipRwi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/MtMdC91TpE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GQiRc84Kd31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/dUazhzPMs91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/B6EfjSgeCU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qaUnHX7vWH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ffsjYfpj9g1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/urv4vqzipz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/nkFTKxYeNR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/TBXNSihbn71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","u